    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Correlated application logs",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "LOGS_UID"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 60,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"propertyflow-server\",deployment_environment=\"dev\"} | http_route != \"/api/ready\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{job_outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Operations and cost controls",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 68,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Backend metrics, logs and traces are scoped to Property Flow dev. Browser operation metrics cover explicit product operations; full RUM is in [Frontend Observability](/a/grafana-kowalski-app/apps/1169). RUM data requires the next approved frontend release.\n\nReview [alert rules](/alerting/list?search=label%3Aservice%3Dpropertyflow), [notification routing](/alerting/routes), and [usage](/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage). AWS CloudWatch scraping is not active; infrastructure setup remains a separate reviewed change. See the repository monitoring coverage register for acceptance checks and remaining gaps."
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
